{"id":"n64493-1-9","stage":5,"title":"무너뜨리다 · 推倒","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64493-1-9-1","ko":"왜 동전으로 탑을 쌓았다 무너뜨렸다 하는 거야?","zh":"为什么要用硬币堆塔又推倒呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동전으로","meaning":"硬币","explanation":"동전：硬币；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"동전","audio":"/audio/cde4842b8ab41342df40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48655","senseId":"1","lemma":"동전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"탑을","meaning":"塔","explanation":"탑：塔；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"탑","audio":"/audio/b085b3dff6de4ca1302c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72178","senseId":"1","lemma":"탑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쌓았다","meaning":"堆，叠放","explanation":"쌓다：堆，叠放；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"쌓다","audio":"/audio/a0dfc8fef79804fd89ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62095","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무너뜨렸다","meaning":"推倒，摧垮，毁坏，使倒塌","explanation":"무너뜨리다：推倒，摧垮，毁坏，使倒塌；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"무너뜨리다","audio":"/audio/fb393cef027827105463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64493","senseId":"1","lemma":"무너뜨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"cde4842b8ab41342","term":"동전","zh":"硬币","audio":"/audio/cde4842b8ab41342df40.mp3","entryId":"48655","definition":"用铜等金属制成的圆形货币。","pronunciation":["동전"]},{"id":"b085b3dff6de4ca1","term":"탑","zh":"塔","audio":"/audio/b085b3dff6de4ca1302c.mp3","entryId":"72178","definition":"由多层构成的高耸型点式建筑物。","pronunciation":["탑"]},{"id":"a0dfc8fef79804fd","term":"쌓다","zh":"堆，叠放","audio":"/audio/a0dfc8fef79804fd89ca.mp3","entryId":"62095","definition":"将多个东西层层撂起。","pronunciation":["싸타"]},{"id":"fb393cef02782710","term":"무너뜨리다","zh":"推倒，摧垮，毁坏，使倒塌","audio":"/audio/fb393cef027827105463.mp3","entryId":"64493","definition":"使堆积物坍塌。","pronunciation":["무너뜨리다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/994a59186a3f0749ce05.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64493-1-9-2","ko":"너무 지루해서 지루함을 달래 보려고.","zh":"因为太无聊了，想找点事情打发时间。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지루해서","meaning":"无聊","explanation":"지루하다：无聊；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"지루하다","audio":"/audio/dc61396243e54920c51c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27798","senseId":"1","lemma":"지루하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지루함을","meaning":"无聊","explanation":"지루하다：无聊；ㅁ：将前面的动作或状态名词化，常用于书面表达。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지루하다","audio":"/audio/dc61396243e54920c51c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27798","senseId":"1","lemma":"지루하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달래","meaning":"排遣，消解，排解","explanation":"달래다：排遣，消解，排解；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"달래다","audio":"/audio/b7bef85c2b9f1e069078.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28383","senseId":"2","lemma":"달래다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보려고.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"dc61396243e54920","term":"지루하다","zh":"无聊","audio":"/audio/dc61396243e54920c51c.mp3","entryId":"27798","definition":"因同样的状态持续不断而感到厌倦枯燥。","pronunciation":["지루하다"]},{"id":"b7bef85c2b9f1e06","term":"달래다","zh":"排遣，消解，排解","audio":"/audio/b7bef85c2b9f1e069078.mp3","entryId":"28383","definition":"使难受的感情或劳顿的身体得以舒缓。","pronunciation":["달래다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ef75adac19f390de565c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.489,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64493","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3157,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为太无聊了，想找点事情打发时间。","我疼得要死了。","为什么要用硬币堆塔又推倒呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为太无聊了，想找点事情打发时间。","为什么要用硬币堆塔又推倒呢？","我疼得要死了。"],"answer":0}]}
